## 🚀 **How to Build & Run the Docker Image**

Follow these steps to build and run the app inside a Docker container:

### 1. Build the Docker Image
Run the following command to build the Docker image:

bash
docker build -t online-shop .

- This will build the image and tag it as `online-shop`.

### 2. Run the Docker Container
After the image is built, run the app inside a container using:

bash
docker run -d -p 3000:3000 online-shop

- `-d`: Runs the container in detached mode (in the background).
- `-p 3000:3000`: Maps port 3000 on your computer to port 3000 in the container.

### 3. Access the Application
Once the container is running, you can access the app in your browser by visiting:

bash
http://localhost:3000


